%SIXMD 1
# @?TOUCH - CREATE FILES WITHOUT TRUNCATING THEM

## DESCRIPTION

OPENS OR CREATES EACH FILE WITHOUT TRUNCATING EXISTING CONTENT.

USAGE IS 'TOUCH FILE ...'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/TOUCH
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/TOUCH.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

